  scan qr code if available

- register equipment without qr code : with the same identify equipment logic

- put equipment on a shelf : start movement with quantity with null sourceshelf to a shelf in equipment with 
  quantity or for serial number equipment 

- change equipment shelf : same previous step but not nullable shelf source

- change equipment status : change status of serial number equipment and each status has actions

- start repair : set shelf to null when he starting repair then change serial number equipment status

- mark repair as completed : change status equipment serial number then he can put it on a shelf (start movement 
from null source shelf to destination shelf to a serial equipment then change the shelf place)

- send equipment to external repair : change status of equipment of a serial number start mouvement from  a shelf 
to a null shelf 

- receive equipment back after external repair : start a mouvement from a null shelf to a shelf and change
 equipment status

